// (3) out_different: Each bit of this output vector should indicate whether the corresponding input bit is different from its neighbour to the left. For example, out_different[1] should indicate if in[1] is different from in[2]. For this part, treat the vector as wrapping around, so in[8]'s neighbour to the left is in[0].
module top_module (
	input [8:0] in,
	output [7:0] out_both,
	output [8:1] out_any,
	output [8:0] out_different);

